{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>from the fire, all their offering.</b> Included in this are the meal-offering of fine flour, and the meal-offering baked in an oven, and the meal-offering of a griddle, and the meal-offering of a deep pan." "<b>and all their sin.</b> These are sin-offerings." "<b>and all their guilt.</b> These are guilt-offerings." "<b>which they shall render to Me.</b> This is robbery of a convert, as it is written in the portion נשא: ״האשם המושב לי׳ לכהן״."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:38.069845165Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}